{"id":"661686","name":"嫩玉米浆饼","author":"双鱼座的美食","authorId":"11350065","desc":"","cover":"images/661686/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"嫩玉米","amount":"10个"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"3个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"嫩玉米用擦子擦碎，成嫩玉米浆。","img":"images/661686/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"用这个擦就行。","img":"images/661686/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入3个鸡蛋，葱末，盐，面粉。","img":"images/661686/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加水。","img":"images/661686/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌成糊糊。","img":"images/661686/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"饼铛放油，油热后倒入一勺糊糊。","img":"images/661686/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"用铲子摊开。","img":"images/661686/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"变色后翻面。","img":"images/661686/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"翻面。","img":"images/661686/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"另一面都上火后，就熟了。","img":"images/661686/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"当个早餐挺不错的。","img":"images/661686/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"粘玉米不加面粉也行，甜玉米没有粘性就得加点面粉。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}